//// rakun-starter-security — a starter: a curated dependency set, and no code.
////
//// Declaring it pulls `rakun-starter`, `rakun-security` and `rakun-session`. An application keeps importing from the modules
//// themselves (`from "rakun-web"`, `from "rakun-cache"`, …); nothing is
//// importable from the starter, so a starter can drop a module without
//// breaking an import. The versions are `rakun/version_set`'s.
